# Review-model selection for the scheduled plan reviews (daily + weekly).
#
# Sourced by scripts/automation/daily-review.sh and weekly-review.sh. Both
# launchers log which model they chose on every run.
#
# REVIEW_MODEL_DEFAULT is what the reviews normally run on. The optional
# override below exists so a temporary model swap is one dated edit rather
# than a hunt through two launchers, and — the point — so the swap **expires
# on its own**: nobody has to remember to revert it, and no scheduled session
# can silently keep running on a model that was only meant to be borrowed.
#
# To borrow a model: set REVIEW_MODEL_OVERRIDE, REVIEW_MODEL_OVERRIDE_UNTIL
# (inclusive, YYYY-MM-DD, local) and REVIEW_MODEL_OVERRIDE_REASON. To end one
# early: blank REVIEW_MODEL_OVERRIDE. Either way the launchers fall back to
# the default with no other edit. Implementer runs never read this file.

REVIEW_MODEL_DEFAULT="claude-fable-5-1"

REVIEW_MODEL_OVERRIDE=""
REVIEW_MODEL_OVERRIDE_UNTIL=""
REVIEW_MODEL_OVERRIDE_REASON=""
